  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You have a number of Karma points per long rest equal to your proficiency bonus and the bonus for the prime ability of your class.</p><p>As a free action, you can activate a karma point. It will stay activated till you use it or take a long rest.</p><p>While you have Karma activated you can add a d6 to one attack roll, saving throw, ability check, damage roll, or healing roll.</p><p>All Karma points are restored after a long rest.</p><p></p><p>NOTE:</p><p>Use @prof + @abilities.str.mod with the appropriate primary ability mod in the Max Usage field for non-spellcasting classes.</p><p><strong>GPS setup:</strong> All optional roll categories share one activation. Healing uses Midi's damage-roll bonus dialog. Consuming the bonus removes the activated effect.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
